.* DSPOBJAUT: who may use an object and how.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Quartz Systems 2026
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=BITSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 60'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=AUTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OWNER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGP CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*NONE'.
:VAR NAME=ASPDEV CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*SYSBAS'.
:VAR NAME=AUTL CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*NONE'.
:VAR NAME=USER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=GROUP CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=AUT CLASS=AUTCL.
:VAR NAME=BITS CLASS=BITSCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=AUTS VARS='USER GROUP AUT BITS'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display detail object authorities
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F17 ACTION=TOP.F17=Top
:KEYI KEY=F18 ACTION=BOTTOM.F18=Bottom
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPOBJAUT KEYL=KEYS HELP=DSPOAUTH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Object Authority
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=41.
:DATAC.Object . . . . . . . :   &OBJ.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Library  . . . . . :     &OBJLIB.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.Object type  . . . . :   &OBJTYPE.
:DATACOL WIDTH=37.
:DATAC.Owner  . . . . . . . :   &OWNER.
:DATAC.Primary group  . . . :   &PGP.
:DATAC.ASP device . . . . . :   &ASPDEV.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.Object secured by authorization list  . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &AUTL.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=AUTS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/USER' VAR=USER USAGE=OUTPUT.User
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/GROUP' VAR=GROUP USAGE=OUTPUT.Group
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/AUT' VAR=AUT USAGE=OUTPUT.Object Authority
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/BITS' VAR=BITS USAGE=OUTPUT.Opr Mgt Exist Alter Ref  Read Add Upd Dlt Exe
:LISTVIEW COLS='USER GROUP AUT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='USER BITS'.
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPOAUTH.Display Object Authority - Help
:P.The object's owner, its primary group and authorization list,
then each user with a private authority and the public's. F11 shows
each authority one by one, an X where the user has it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the display, F12 goes back one display.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USER'.User
:P.The user of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/GROUP'.Group
:P.The group of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/AUT'.Object Authority
:P.The object Authority of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/BITS'.Opr Mgt Exist Alter Ref  Read Add Upd Dlt Exe
:P.The opr Mgt Exist Alter Ref Read Add Upd Dlt Exe of each entry in the
list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
